><em>. </em></p><p><em>you can </em><strong><em>listen to an excerpt</em></strong><em> below ~</em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n\n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <a href=\"https://keningzhu.notion.site/tinctures-excerpt\" target=\"_blank\">\n    explore this artifact\n  </a>\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>purpose</strong> — to practice the precision of meeting ourselves in every moment, giving to ourselves the care that we need — through the distilled essence of a micro-practice.<br /><br /><strong>guiding question — </strong>how can I practice noticing what I feel and giving myself a potent distillation of what I need?</p><p><strong>astrological season:</strong> Virgo</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n\n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>see also: </strong><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/micro-practices-as-portals-to-your-art\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>micro-practices as portals to your art</strong></a><strong><br />🦋 explore </strong><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/labyrinth\"><strong>labyrinth library</strong></a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n ","author":"Kening Zhu","siteTitle":"kening zhu","siteHash":"ef8a94b9fc20c32a4ee7d94ee971337d278e8b2fafe747123e4eb5cea026e84e","entryHash":"502dfeaefc6ceca6e44709c6a5ee312cc700d34157567ad7ebd07be3a6d7326d","category":"Sites"}